Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episod}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:04.16,0:00:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simt că Nadeshiko \Ncontinuă să mă obosească.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar să ai o relație sexuală \Ncu un robot este puțin...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.47,0:00:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar, stai,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.78,0:00:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}e drăguț să ai pe cineva \Ncare să te întâmpine acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.95,0:00:21.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am întors!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ai revenit, Akane!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.06,0:00:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Retrag ce am spus!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.19,0:00:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dori cina?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O baie?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.27,0:00:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau pe {\i1}mine{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.73,0:00:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se pare că a intrat în faza \Nde proaspăt căsătorită.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gata, ajunge.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Care-i treaba cu toată \Nmâncarea asta elegantă?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am pregătit-o pentru tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai și funcții de gătit?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.69,0:00:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am fost programată pentru \Ncomunicare, în special,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.15,0:00:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar pot sintetiza informații noi \Npentru a îndeplini și alte sarcini.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg asta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.53,0:01:03.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ai dori să faci prima oară?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.24,0:01:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă poți mânca pe \Nmine dacă dorești...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.29,0:01:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi mânca cina, apoi voi face o \Nbaie și apoi voi merge la culcare!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.80,0:01:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai făcut o baie \Ncaldă de luni de zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.91,0:01:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nadeshiko a arătat că poate face și alte lucruri decât cele pentru care a fost programată.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poate gândi și \Nînvăța exact ca un om.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.37,0:01:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane? Temperatura apei e potrivită?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți amintești că te-am întrebat, nu? \NDupă cină și baie, urmez eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, nu, sunt în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.39,0:01:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-De ce e așa de alunecos?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.86,0:01:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am adăugat niște săruri de baie \Ncare conțin un agent lubrificant.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.67,0:01:44.58,Dialogue,,350,0,0,,{\i1}A trecut atât de mult timp de la \Nultima baie încât nici n-am observat!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.19,0:01:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai! Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.37,0:01:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te va lua amețeala dacă \Nstai prea mult în cadă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există și alte moduri de a ne distra aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.84,0:01:58.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spre exemplu, așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci acesta e planul tău, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.84,0:02:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plan? Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.82,0:02:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se simte așa de bine când \Ncorpurile noastre ude se ating.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar e destul de ciudat...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.24,0:02:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simt cum devin din \Nce în ce mai excitată.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.70,0:02:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că ești mai \Nexcitată decât de obicei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil e de la broasca țestoasă cu carapace moale de la cină.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.12,0:02:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atât de mult vrei să facem sex?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da. Deoarece...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.18,0:02:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,te iubesc foarte mult, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.56,0:02:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mă iubește? Probabil a fost \Nprogramată să spună asta, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar tu, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu mă iubești?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.97,0:03:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt mult prea excitată ca să pot gândi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.76,0:03:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.83,0:03:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze! Am uitat să continui \Nsă-mi mișc mâinile.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu-mi vine să cred că m-a făcut să \Nscot acele sunete toată noaptea trecută.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.65,0:03:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, un e-mail.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.92,0:03:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.56,0:03:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O întâlnire anonimă online \Na deținătorilor de roboți sexuali?
